# and the shared/, server/ and web/ packages.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/*.log
.git
.github
.claude
.specify
.vscode
.idea
docs
specs
